Yikes, 8.2Gi free out of 460 — definitely tight. Let me investigate where the space is going before suggesting anything to remove. I'll run a few read-only commands to survey the situation.
{
  "command": "du -sh ~/Library/Caches ~/Library/Logs ~/Downloads ~/Documents ~/Desktop ~/Movies ~/Pictures ~/Music 2>/dev/null"
}

